## Import recommendations:

**HIGH priority** (Tier 1): Sections 00-04 provide complete conceptual understanding—core classification framework, physical motivation, and primary applications for line/point defects.

**MEDIUM-HIGH priority** (Tier 2): Section 05 (pumping cycles) and Appendix E (time-reversal symmetric invariants) extend to quantum computation and rigorous time-reversal physics.

**MEDIUM/LOW priority** (Tiers 3-4): Appendices with mathematical proofs, explicit formulas, and specialized calculations—useful references but not essential for conceptual understanding.

All files include proper YAML front matter with timestamps and metadata.
